OL,3,GNEWSAWhere has #450m Borderlands
OL,4,Afunding gone?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt began as a promise to boost the
OL,7,Feconomic fortunes of the five council
OL,8,Fareas either side of the
OL,9,FEngland-Scotland border.
OL,11,FAfter years of negotiations, the
OL,12,FBorderlands Growth Deal was finally
OL,13,Fsigned in 2021.
OL,15,FHailed as an "ambitious approach to
OL,16,Fcross-border working", nearly half a
OL,17,Fbillion pounds of investment was
OL,18,Fpromised from the UK and Scottish
OL,19,Fgovernments over a decade.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
