OL,3,GNEWSAWhere has #450m Borderlands
OL,4,Afunding gone?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut at the halfway point, only three
OL,7,Fprojects in England are fully complete,
OL,8,Fand the deal has been criticised for
OL,9,Fdelays and bureaucratic setbacks.
